# Local-only design material: textures/models extracted from the dependency jars plus
# decompiled class dumps under design/refs/. design/render_items.py reads them, but they
# are third-party content and can be re-extracted from libs/*.jar at any time.
design/refs/

# Dependency jars in libs/ are intentionally NOT ignored: the build runs offline and needs them.
